<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">55块2 · 储蓄</view><view class="title">小荷包</view><view class="card"><view class="caption">已执行累计</view><view class="amount">¥ {{current}}</view><view class="progress progress-target"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{goalProgress}}%;"></view><view class="goal-marker" style="left: {{goalMarker}}%;"></view></view><view class="target-line"><text>¥0</text><text>¥{{goal}}</text><text>¥{{target}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>距离截止日</text><text class="value">{{daysLeft}} 天</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>当前情景完成度</text><text class="value">{{targetProgress}}%</text></view><view class="caption">10,000 元是心理目标，右端是当前预算情景的最终目标。只有执行发薪日划转后，金额才会进入这里。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">已登记流水</view><view class="list-row"><text>工资卡 ①</text><text class="value">¥{{bankBalance}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>余额宝 ②</text><text class="value">¥{{poolBalance}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>小荷包 ③</text><text class="value">¥{{pocketBalance}}</text></view><view class="caption">计划累计与实际流水分开显示，避免把“准备存”误认为“已经存”。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">小荷包流水</view><view class="list-row"><text>逐笔合计</text><text class="value">¥{{pocketNetText}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>发薪转入</text><text class="value">¥{{pocketIncomeText}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>专项支出</text><text class="value">− ¥{{pocketSpecialText}}</text></view><view class="list-row" wx:if="{{pocketAdjustText !== '¥0.00'}}"><text>校准净额</text><text class="value">{{pocketAdjustText}}</text></view><view class="caption">{{pocketMatched ? '逐笔合计与当前余额一致' : '逐笔合计与当前余额不一致，请在“我的”里做一次余额校准'}}</view><view wx:if="{{pocketEvents.length === 0}}" class="muted pocket-empty">还没有涉及小荷包的流水</view><view wx:for="{{pocketEvents}}" wx:key="id" class="flow-row"><view class="flow-body"><view class="flow-title"><text class="flow-tag">{{item.typeLabel}}</text>{{item.title}}</view><view class="flow-sub">{{item.flowText}}</view><view class="flow-time">{{item.eventDate}}　{{item.timeShort}}<text wx:if="{{item.note}}">　·　{{item.note}}</text></view></view><view class="flow-side"><view class="flow-amount {{item.signedFen > 0 ? 'inflow' : (item.signedFen < 0 ? 'outflow' : 'neutral')}}">{{item.amountText}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{pocketMore > 0}}" class="caption">还有 {{pocketMore}} 笔未列出</view><button class="button secondary" bindtap="openPocketLedger">查看全部小荷包流水</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">登记专项支出</view><input class="special-input" placeholder="例如 Q4 水电" value="{{specialReason}}" bindinput="inputSpecialReason" /><input class="special-input" type="digit" placeholder="金额，例如 405.88" value="{{specialAmount}}" bindinput="inputSpecialAmount" /><button class="button secondary" bindtap="saveSpecial">从小荷包登记</button></view><view class="section-label">五期储蓄轨迹</view><block wx:for="{{periods}}" wx:key="index"><view class="card period-card"><view class="list-row"><view><view>{{item.completed ? '已完成' : '待完成'}}　·　第 {{item.index}} 期</view><view class="secondary-text">{{item.payDate}}　·　{{item.special}}</view></view><view class="value">¥{{item.actualAfter}}</view></view><view class="caption">本期实际转存 ¥{{item.save}}　·　计划累计 ¥{{item.pocket}}</view></view></block><view class="card"><view class="section-title">储蓄原则</view><view class="caption">先把今天过好，再让每一次结算都变成确定的积累。</view></view></view>
